    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> then&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is",
