  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>For function <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />L.H.L.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>h</mi></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />R.H.L.&nbsp;<math><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Since,&nbsp;<math><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math></p><p>therefore, <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is not continuous and&nbsp;not differentiable at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
